      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://example.com/blog/posts/typed-templates/</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Templates are Elm functions, so a typo in a field name is a compile error.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
